WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:02.300
Hey, how's it going bros? This is Pewdiepie!

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:06.840
Pokemon Go... I can't stop playing, I'm level 25...

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:08.420
My legs hurt though.

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:12.860
What does everyone want from Pokemon Go? What is the one thing that we're all missing?

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.880
That's right. To play from your computer.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.140
That's what we're gonna do today.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:21.400
Now, you may think we hacked the game...? Fuck that, we're not cheaters.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.400
Right Micheal?
Michael: We're not cheaters.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.960
That's right, we're not cheaters.

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:28.640
Marzia bought one of these very expensive... [Laughs]

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:32.780
...drones. To shoot videos with.

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:34.900
I... I could..- The audio.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:38.460
I was allowed to borrow this. But if I break it...

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:40.220
...she's literally going to kill me.

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:43.100
So we're gonna put my phone on this! [Laughs]

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:46.660
And we're gonna play Pokemon Go... remotely.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:49.620
Let's do it. [Laughs]

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.240
So 13 days ago, someone posted this. I didn't see it until now...

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:56.420
But someone's already attempted this.

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:59.820
But we don't have any proof. All right, we're gonna actually do this shit.

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:02.040
He's asking: is this cheating?

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:04.660
We're about to find out.

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:13.640
We're gonna duct tape... my Samsung S7, I love so dearly, to this very other expensive piece of equipment.

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:16.580
Hopefully nothing goes wrong. Let's do it.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:20.960
So right now I'm duct-taping my phone, underneath the drone.

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:22.940
...as securely as I can.

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:27.120
I'm actually really nervous. But I think that's pretty good actually!

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:29.820
Like, out of all the stupid ideas...

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:31.800
...this is by far the best one. [Snorts]

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:37.940
So the idea is that the drone is gonna move us to a location where there is a lot of Pokemons.

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:44.900
Then there's a program, by my computer, where I'll be sitting here controlling the drone, looking at the footage,.

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:50.860
...while at the same time I'll see my screen on my computer... Catching Pokemons.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.160
The way the game was made...

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:56.780
This is how Nintendo visioned this game to be played by everyone.

00:01:57.040 --> 00:02:01.080
Now, there are a couple things that may or may not go wrong... [laughs]

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.700
Is it powerful enough to lift this phone?

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:04.980
I don't know.

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:06.200
Is the phone gonna stick?

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:08.220
These are very powerful fans, you know?

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:11.240
Could this go wrong? Yes. Let's just keep--let's just do-- let's just do it.

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:13.240
There's only one way to find out, let's just do it.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:15.400
[Reading] "Update firmware?" Don't make me laugh.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:16.780
Alright, here we go.

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:18.780
There we are. Hi.

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:20.920
We're live. Alright, drone.

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:22.140
Make me proud!

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:23.760
Now go and catch some Pokemons!

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:26.340
We're in our phone. That's on the drone.

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:28.340
Opening the Pokemon Go app.

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:30.340
Oh, we got a lot of Drowzees nearby!

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:33.660
Oh, it's making clicks, and shit. I didn't click for that.

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:37.440
Maybe the tape is like, fuckin' up the display a lil' bit?

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:39.800
We ran into a problem right away, didn't we! [wheezes]

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:43.640
The touch screen is fucked, because of the tape, so we have to put something in between.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.800
[Plastic rustling] Luckily, we found one of these.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:48.180
Fits perfectly.

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:50.500
No... touch screen is working

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:56.680
Who needs... a thirty dollar case when PewDiePie can make one for you, uh...

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:00.840
Just $29.99, alright? Much better quality.

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:02.840
[French accent] Second attempt!

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:05.000
This looks like a fuckin' bomb, doesn't it?

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.700
[Seagulls cawing] Alright, it's time to fly.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:11.080
[Fans whirring]

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:13.100
[Pewds, under the noise] Oh my God!

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:15.940
[Fans whirring, seagulls cawing]

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:17.100
[Offscreen yawn]

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:19.100
[Pewds, shouting] Go, Pokemon!

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:28.620
Marzia's gonna kill me...

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:30.620
If I fuck this up.

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:33.560
Let's not fuck it up.

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.840
[Laughing] The drone is stabilized.

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:37.840
[Unintelligible talking]

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:41.980
Okay. Here we go.

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:43.860
We're flying freestyle.

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:46.960
Oh my fucking God, I am SWEATING.

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:51.120
I am SWEATING! [chuckles]

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:54.440
Fucking--Oh! [Scrambling for words] Mission gone!

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:55.660
Nope!

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:57.460
Oh, it's still--It's still there.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:04:05.120
[Sad piano]

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:07.080
We're switching phones

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.080
Because the Samsung is so--

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:13.100
...Maybe it's the edge screen? I don't know, but it's so sensitive to, like...

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.100
Touch--touch, or whatever?

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:17.100
Even though we try and pack it nicely

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:20.040
So we're gonna try it with a Sony, see if that works.

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:23.020
Plus, I got this one for free, so if it falls off...

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:24.160
It's less of a pain.

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:27.040
Honestly, I'm suprised we didn't do this right before [laughs]

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:28.060
What do you think about this?

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:31.920
Michael: "Ooooooh shiiiiiit" 
Pewds: Yeah. Yeah, this should work, right?

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:33.680
Michael: "The box"

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:36.920
Why did we not do this-- this is like-- that looks fuckin' GOOD.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:39.280
This looks like a pro did it.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:43.020
We've been goin' for about an hour and a half [laughs]

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:47.120
So far we put the phone in the air, but no Pokemon.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:49.980
[Sighs] Alright. It's gonna rain soon.

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:52.840
Starting up. [Drone beeps]

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:55.380
The camera realizes that it can't move.

00:04:56.840 --> 00:05:00.540
[Pathetic drone noises]

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:02.540
[Michael, laughing] "Oh no!"

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:04.540
Come on, camera.

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:08.540
We have to move it backward a little bit, maybe?

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:10.540
[Michael, laughing] "So cute!"

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:12.160
Pewds: You think this is funny?

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:14.160
Michael: "It's fuckin' h--"

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:16.160
Pewds: You think this is FUNNY? ...Goddammit!

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:18.900
[Sad piano]

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:22.040
Alright, Michael thinks it's okay.

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:26.380
[Clicking] Yeah, we're in. [Loud clank] Jesus! Wh--

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:30.260
[Whirring]

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:38.220
[Seagulls cawing]

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:42.640
Get me my FUCKING charizard!

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:44.640
Alright. Now, we're gonna get over there.

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:45.520
There we go.

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:50.140
[Intense music]

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:51.640
[Sudden change to sad piano]

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:52.920
[Music resumes] Michael: Go!

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:54.600
But where are the Pokemons?

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:56.600
Let's plu-- let's put a bait on that one.

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:59.800
[Intense music continues]

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:01.680
This is working pretty good, man.

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:03.360
[Music stops] Oh! We got a Drowzee.

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:05.360
[Music resumes] Here we go.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:10.660
Swiping--

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:12.780
We got it!

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:14.780
Okay, we got it in the Pokeball! [Claps]

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:19.800
WE GOT IT! [Celebratory music] Yes!!! [Laughs]

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:23.540
Where's the drone, seriously? Ok there it i--[laughs]

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:27.060
[Pewds, quietly, laughing] ...So funny, [unintelligible]

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:29.580
Pewds: Oh God, it's going so high!

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:33.440
Okay, we-- we got what we came for [laughs] let's get it back pl--

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:40.380
For a fuckin' Drowzee, man!

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:43.240
Now let's get this baby home safe!

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:50.820
[Drone whirring]

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:55.020
PERFECT LANDING!!! Hoooo yeah!!!

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:58.960
We got a Drowzee! [laughs]

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:00.960
[Quietly, laughing] ...So fuckin' dumb!

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:04.320
[Breathes in] Okay! [Laughs] Fuckin' [unintelligible]

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:10.480
There it is. [Laughs] It's a fuckin' Drowzee

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:12.760
Ohhhhh, dude.

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:16.020
Now I know how they felt like when they landed on the moon-- [Laughs]

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:25.660
Alright, so we did it! We caught a Pokemon, while using a drone

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:28.460
I know it's not much, but... I still think that was pretty cool

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.540
I didn't think we would actually be able to DO it!

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:32.840
This is my second time ever flying a drone,

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:35.780
and I was kinda scared of--of just--losing the drone

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:39.100
If you have more experiences with drones, you could TOTALLY...

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:40.380
...pull this off.

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:42.380
Especially if you wanna HATCH EGGS.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.160
Heyy...

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:45.160
But that was pretty much it, I hope you bros enjoyed!

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:48.920
Leave a like, and we might try some more weird shit like this [laughs]

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:51.240
And as always, thanks for watching [kisses fist]

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:52.960
[Deep, gruff voice] Stay awesome, bros.

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:55.240
[Intense music]

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:57.240
They said I would never catch it.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:58.680
But they were WRONG.

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:02.040
THERE IT IS!!

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:05.260
OH MY GOD!! OH MY GOD!!!!

00:08:05.260 --> 00:08:06.180
Cameraman,

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.000
It's been a pleasure working by your side.

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:12.400
But once I go in, I won't make it back.

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:14.160
"What do you mean, 'go in'?"

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:16.160
[Trails off]

